"click :guilabel:`New` or select an existing rank."
msgstr ""
"Untuk membuat peringkat baru atau memodifikasi peringkat default, "
"buka :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Forum: Ranks` dan "
"klik :guilabel:`New` atau pilih peringkat yang ada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/forum.rst:234
msgid ""
"Add the :guilabel:`Rank Name`, the :guilabel:`Required Karma` points to "
"reach it, its :guilabel:`Description`, a :guilabel:`Motivational` message to "
"encourage users to reach it, and an image."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan :guilabel:`Rank Name`, poin :guilabel:`Required Karma` yang "
"diperlukan untuk mencapainya, :guilabel:`Description`, "
"pesan :guilabel:`Motivational` untuk mendorong user mencapainya, dan gambar."

